 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig                 |  11 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Makefile                |   1 +
 .../gpu/drm/panel/panel-google-comet-ct3d.c   | 191 ++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 204 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-google-comet-ct3d.c

