+	select DRM_DISPLAY_HELPER
+	help
+	  Boot-handoff driver for the outer CT3D panel of the Pixel 9 Pro
+	  Fold (comet): keeps the bootloader's panel state and re-sends only
+	  the DSC PPS.
+
